      "source": [
        "With the same posterior formulation as in Lasso, we can plug in the Gaussian prior to get:\n",
        "\n",
        "$\\mathcal{L}(Y | X, \\beta) P(\\beta) = \\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}\\sigma}\\right)^n \\exp\\left(-\\frac{1}{2\\sigma^2}\\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\epsilon_i^2\\right) * \\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi} \\tau}\\right)^p \\exp\\left(-\\frac{1}{2\\tau^2}\\sum_{j=1}^{p} \\beta_j^2\\right)$\n",
        "\n",
        "To get the MAP estimate, we take the log of the posterior distribution:\n",
        "\n",
        "$\\underbrace{\\underbrace{nlog(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}\\sigma}) + plog(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi} \\tau})}_{Constant} - \\underbrace{(\\frac{1}{2\\sigma^2}\\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\epsilon_i^2 + \\frac{1}{2\\tau^2}\\sum_{j=1}^{p} \\beta_j^2)}_{Minimize this}}_{In\\ order\\ to\\ maximize\\ this}$\n",
        "\n",
        "Now the problem becomes:\n",
        "\n",
        "$arg\\min_{\\beta} \\left( \\frac{1}{2\\sigma^2}\\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\epsilon_i^2 + \\frac{1}{2\\tau^2}\\sum_{j=1}^{p} \\beta_j^2 \\right)$\n",
        "\n",
        "$=arg\\min_{\\beta} \\frac{1}{2\\sigma^2}\\left( \\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\epsilon_i^2 + \\frac{\\sigma^2}{\\tau^2}\\sum_{j=1}^{p} \\beta_j^2 \\right)$\n",
        "\n",
        "which is equivalent to:\n",
        "\n",
        "$arg\\min_{\\beta} \\left( RSS + \\lambda\\sum_{j=1}^{p} \\beta_j^2 \\right)$\n",
        "\n",
        "where $\\lambda = \\frac{\\sigma^2}{\\tau^2}$.\n",
        "\n",
        "Therefore, the Ridge solutions are the maximum a posteriori (MAP) estimates under a Gaussian prior.\n",
        "\n",
        "From Figure.3, we can see that the smaller $\\sigma$ gets, or equivalently, the larger $\\lambda$ gets, the distribution gets more concentrated around zero.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Elastic Net\n",
        "\n",
        "Elastic Net regularization, we use the product of Laplace and Gaussian prior distributions for the coefficients:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "P(\\beta) = \\frac{1}{2b} \\exp\\left(-\\frac{|\\beta|}{b}\\right) * \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi} \\tau} \\exp\\left(-\\frac{\\beta^2}{2\\tau^2}\\right)\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "$P(\\beta) \\propto \\exp\\left(-\\frac{|\\beta|}{b}-\\frac{\\beta^2}{2\\tau^2}\\right)$\n"
      ],
