      "source": [
        "We proceed the same way as in Lasso and Ridge to get the MAP estimate of $\\beta$ under the Elastic Net prior, which leads to the minimarzation problem:\n",
        "\n",
        "$arg\\min_{\\beta} \\frac{1}{2\\sigma^2}\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\epsilon_i^2 + \\frac{2\\sigma^2}{b}\\sum_{j=1}^{p} |\\beta_j| + \\frac{\\sigma^2}{\\tau^2}\\sum_{j=1}^{p} \\beta_j^2 \\right)$\n",
        "\n",
        "$=arg\\min_{\\beta}\\left(RSS + \\lambda_1\\sum_{j=1}^{p} |\\beta_j| + \\lambda_2\\sum_{j=1}^{p} \\beta_j^2 \\right)$\n",
        "\n",
        "where $\\lambda_1 = \\frac{2\\sigma^2}{b}$ and $\\lambda_2 = \\frac{\\sigma^2}{\\tau^2}$ are the regularization parameters for the L1 and L2 penalties, respectively.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Conclusion\n",
